            "review_text": "Gene P\nSan Fernando, Philippines607 contributions\n0\nVery Good Banh Mi\nMay 2019 • Friends\nThe place is a hole in the wall. We were seeing a lot of local people lining up to buy banh mi or kebab. We lined up and bought banh mi and it was a revelation. The ingredients were fresh and tasty. The meat was real beef and well cooked and seasoned. The sandwich was big all for just 30k. A good meal for a discounted price. A must eat in the city.\nWritten May 1, 2019",
