            "review_text": "Zfy Ed\nSingapore, Singapore10979 contributions\n0\nA good supper!\nMar 2019 • Family\nAfter visiting the weekend night market (please refer to my earlier review of this place here) where we shopped and bought a great number of things, we were hungry and on our way back to our hotel, we passed by this eatery, as it is just located a few steps away.\n\nIt was around 10.00pm then but the eatery was still full of diners and not able to find a table (the sitting area was located opposite street, separating from the kitchen) and so we decided to take away.\n\nWe ordered a chicken set with fries and salad. The food were prepared instantly despite of the crowd and waited no more than 5 mins for it. And guess what? The portion was huge and gigantic! Full of chicken, fries and sald!\n\nChicken was cooked perfectly, tender and nice and the salad comprised of lettuce, several types of cabbages, tomatoes and onions. Fries were cruncy and tasty. It's simply delicious.\n\nAnd its great value for money and if I did not remember wrongly, this set was only 50,000 dong.\n\nDefinitely worth recommending it for something that is \"nice, cheap\" and fulfilling!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 26, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
